  "metaDescription": "View our interior painting portfolio featuring bedrooms, kitchens, living spaces, trim, accent walls, and cabinets. Real projects showcasing clean finishes",
  "h1": "Interior Painting Portfolio",
  "bodyHtml": "<h2>Interior Painting Portfolio</h2><p><strong>Residential Interior Projects | The Proud Paintbrush</strong></p><p>Our interior painting portfolio showcases real projects completed by The Proud Paintbrush, highlighting clean finishes, consistent preparation, and attention to detail across a wide range of interior spaces.</p><p>These examples are intended to help homeowners see the quality and style of our work and decide whether our approach is a good fit for their home.</p><h2>Interior Painting Projects</h2><p>Below you’ll find examples of completed interior painting projects, including:</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"/interior-painting/living-room-painting\">Living rooms and open-concept spaces</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/interior-painting/kitchen-painting\">Kitchens </a>and <a href=\"/interior-painting/dining-room-painting\">dining </a>areas</p></li><li><p><a href=\"/interior-painting/bedroom-painting\">Bedrooms </a>and <a href=\"/interior-painting/nursery-painting\">nurseries</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/interior-painting/bathroom-painting\">Bathrooms and powder rooms</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/interior-painting/millwork-painting\">Trim</a>, doors<a href=\"https://mill\">,</a> and <a href=\"/interior-painting/ceiling-painting\">ceilings</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/interior-painting/accent-wall-painting\">Accent walls and feature areas</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/painting-services/cabinet-painting\">Cabinet painting and built-ins</a></p></li></ul><p>Each project reflects our focus on surface preparation, even coverage, and clean execution.</p><h2>What You’ll Notice in Our Interior Work</h2><p>As you browse our interior portfolio, look for:</p><ul><li><p>Smooth, consistent finishes</p></li><li><p>Clean cut lines and edges</p></li><li><p>Proper prep on walls, trim, and ceilings</p></li><li><p>Thoughtful color application</p></li><li><p>Respect for the home during the process</p></li></ul><p>These details are what allow interior paint to hold up over time rather than needing early touch-ups or repainting.</p><h2>Looking for More Details About Interior Painting?</h2><p>If you’d like to learn more about our interior painting process, materials, or what to expect during a project, you can explore the page below.</p><p><a href=\"/painting-services/interior-painting\">→ <strong>Explore Interior Painting Services</strong></a></p><h2>Looking for More Details About Interior Painting?</h2><p>If you’d like to learn more about our interior painting process, materials, or what to expect during a project, you can explore the page below.</p><p><a href=\"/painting-services/interior-painting\">→ <strong>Explore Interior Painting Services</strong></a></p><h2>Interior Portfolio FAQs</h2><p><strong>What types of interior spaces are shown in this portfolio?</strong><br> This portfolio includes bedrooms, kitchens, living areas, bathrooms, hallways, trim, accent walls, and cabinet projects.</p><p><strong>Do you include before-and-after photos?</strong><br> Yes. Many interior projects include before-and-after images to show the full transformation.</p><p><strong>Are these photos from real projects?</strong><br> Yes. All images shown are from completed projects handled by The Proud Paintbrush.</p>",
  "faqs": [],
